{"sha": "cf1f4382132f266f1795fd4872f9e192c0e676505ef420a17e899256b4f39dfd", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:euler-bernoulli} 章 --- 理想流体：欧拉与伯努利}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:1}", "$v_2 = 1.5 \\times 4 = \\qty{6.0}{m/s}$，$P_2 = 3.0 \\times 10^5 - 500(36 - 2.25) =", "\\qty{2.83}{bar}$。在 \\qty{2}{cm} 处：$v = \\qty{24}{m/s}$，$P = 3.0 \\times 10^5 - 500", "(576 - 2.25) = \\qty{0.13}{bar}$——接近蒸气压。负值", "说明所设流量不可能实现：水发生空化，", "流动随之受阻。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:2}", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 15000/0.74} = \\qty{201}{m/s}$；指示空速 $\\sqrt{2 \\times 15000/", "1.22} = \\qty{157}{m/s}$。指示空速反映的是动压，", "也就是机翼所感受到的量：失速速度是固定的\\emph{指示}", "速度，与高度无关。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:3}", "深度 \\qty{2.0}{m}：$v = \\sqrt{2g \\times 2} = \\qty{6.3}{m/s}$；$D_V = 0.6 \\times 10^{-4}", "\\times 6.3 = \\qty{0.38}{L/s}$；下落时间 $\\sqrt{2/g} = \\qty{0.45}{s}$，射程", "\\qty{2.8}{m}。射程 $= 2\\sqrt{h(H - h)}$ 关于 $h \\leftrightarrow H -", "h$ 对称：深度 \\qty{1.0}{m}（离地面 \\qty{2}{m}）的小孔，其水流落在", "同一点。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:4}", "$\\Delta P = \\tfrac12 \\times 1.2 \\times 900 = \\qty{540}{Pa}$，外侧压强较低：", "合力 \\qty{54}{kN}，方向\\emph{向上}；屋顶重 \\qty{49}{kN}，屋顶会", "被掀起。（实际屋顶往往先在边缘处破坏，那里的气流发生分离。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:5}", "(a) $\\tan\\theta = 3/9.81$，$\\theta = \\qty{17}{\\degree}$；$2 \\times 0.306 = \\qty{0.61}{m}$", "（后部更高）。(b) $\\Delta P = \\rho aL = \\qty{6.0}{kPa}$。(c) $\\tan\\theta =", "0.61$，高度差 \\qty{1.22}{m}：前端比平均液面高出", "\\qty{0.61}{m}，平均液面为 \\qty{0.40}{m}：\\qty{1.01}{m} $>$ \\qty{0.8}{m}，液体会碰到盖子。(d) $a = v^2/R =", "\\qty{5.6}{m/s^2}$：$\\theta = \\qty{30}{\\degree}$，外侧更高。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:6}", "(a) 旋转抛物面 $z = z_0 + \\Omega^2r^2/2g$，$\\Omega = 4\\pi = \\qty{12.6}{rad/s}$。(b)", "$\\Omega^2R^2/2g = 158 \\times 0.0225/19.6 = \\qty{0.18}{m}$。(c) 抛物面在圆盘上的平均高度", "恰为中间值：中心 $0.20 - 0.09 = \\qty{0.11}{m}$，边缘", "\\qty{0.29}{m}。(d) 中心恰好干涸的条件是 $\\Omega^2R^2/4g = h_0$：$\\Omega = \\sqrt{4gh_0}/R =", "\\qty{18.7}{rad/s} = 3.0$ 转每秒。(e) 抛物面可将", "平行光线会聚到一点，焦距为 $f = g/2\\Omega^2$；液体镜面望远镜", "让水银旋转而成。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:7}", "(a) $v = \\sqrt{2g \\times 3} = \\qty{7.7}{m/s}$；$D_V = \\pi \\times 10^{-4} \\times 7.7 =", "\\qty{2.4}{L/s}$。(b) $P = P_0 - \\rho g(2) - \\tfrac12\\rho v^2 = 100 - 19.6 - 29.4 =", "\\qty{51}{kPa}$。(c) $P_0 - \\rho gh_c - \\tfrac12\\rho v^2 \\ge \\qty{2.3}{kPa}$：$h_c \\le", "\\qty{7.0}{m}$。(d) 空气可压缩且很轻：没有连续的", "液柱来传递压强，两侧的水只是保持静止。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:8}", "(a) $\\Delta P = mg/S = \\qty{654}{Pa}$；$\\tfrac12\\rho v^2 = \\qty{2.2}{kPa}$，$C_L = 0.30$。", "(b) $v_{\\text{上}}^2 = 58^2 + 2 \\times 654/1.22$：\\qty{66.6}{m/s}。(c) $F_L' =", "\\qty{981}{N/m} = \\rho v\\Gamma$：$\\Gamma = \\qty{13.4}{m^2/s}$。(d) $v = \\sqrt{2mg/", "\\rho SC_L} = \\sqrt{19620/25.6} = \\qty{28}{m/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:9}", "(a) $v_2 = \\qty{2.5}{m/s}$；$\\Delta P = \\tfrac12 \\times 1060 \\times (6.25 - 0.25) =", "\\qty{3.2}{kPa}$，$P_2 = \\qty{9.8}{kPa}$。(b) 仍高于 \\qty{1}{kPa}：否。(c) 在 ", "\\qty{0.05}{cm^2}处，$v = \\qty{5}{m/s}$，$\\Delta P = \\qty{13}{kPa}$：$P_2 \\approx 0$，低于", "组织压强——管壁塌陷，血流中止，", "压强恢复，管壁重新打开：这便是一种颤振（医生听到的杂音）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:10}", "(a) $c_PT_0 = c_PT + v^2/2$，其中 $c_P = \\gamma R/(\\gamma - 1)M_{\\text{摩尔}}$，且", "$c^2 = \\gamma RT/M_{\\text{摩尔}}$：$v^2/2c_PT = \\tfrac12(\\gamma - 1)M^2$。(b) $M =", "0.85$：$T_0 = 220 \\times 1.145 = \\qty{252}{K}$；$M = 2$：$220 \\times 1.8 = \\qty{396}{K}$；", "$M = 25$：$220 \\times 126 = \\qty{28000}{K}$——毫无意义：空气发生离解，", "并发生电离，$c_P$ 不再是常数（真实的滞止温度", "可达数千开尔文）。(c) $P_0/P = (1 + \\tfrac{\\gamma - 1}2M^2)^{\\gamma/(\\gamma", "- 1)} \\approx 1 + \\tfrac{\\gamma}2M^2 + \\tfrac{\\gamma}8M^4$，且 $\\gamma PM^2 = \\rho v^2$：", "$P_0 - P = \\tfrac12\\rho v^2(1 + M^2/4)$。若将 $v$ 按 $\\sqrt{2(P_0 - P)/\\rho}$ 来读取，", "则其被高估的比例为 $\\sqrt{1 + M^2/4} - 1 \\approx 9\\%$（$M = 0.85$ 时）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:11}", "(a) 从液面（$v \\approx 0$，$P_0$，高度 $h$）到出口（$v$，$P_0$，", "高度 $0$），其中 $\\int\\partial_tv\\,\\dd s = \\ell\\,\\dd v/\\dd t$。(b) $\\dd v/(V^2 -", "v^2) = \\dd t/2\\ell$，$V^2 = 2gh$：$\\operatorname{artanh}(v/V) = Vt/2\\ell$。(c) $V =", "\\qty{9.9}{m/s}$；$\\tanh x = 0.9$ 时 $x = 1.47$：$t = 2\\ell x/V = \\qty{15}{s}$。(d)", "$\\dd v/\\dd t \\approx \\qty{-20}{m/s^2}$：$\\Delta P = \\rho\\ell \\times 20 = \\qty{9.9}{bar}$。", "水的可压缩性很小：快速关闭会激起压力", "波，$\\Delta P = \\rho c\\Delta v \\approx \\qty{140}{bar}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:euler-bernoulli:12}", "(a) 定常、理想、不可压缩且无旋：整个流场", "只有一个常数。(b) 在液面上 $P = P_0$：$\\tfrac12\\rho v^2 + \\rho gz =", "0$，$z = -\\Gamma^2/8\\pi^2gr^2$。(c) 径向欧拉方程：$\\partial_rP = \\rho\\Omega^2r$，", "竖直方向为流体静力学：液面满足 $z(r) - z(a) = \\Omega^2(r^2 -", "a^2)/2g$。(d) 浴缸：$\\Omega = \\Gamma/2\\pi a^2 = \\qty{191}{rad/s}$；$z(a) = -\\Omega^2a^2/", "2g = \\qty{-4.7}{cm}$，涡核还要再下降 \\qty{4.7}{cm}：总深度为 \\qty{9.3}{cm}。", "龙卷风：外侧一份 $\\Delta P = \\tfrac12\\rho v_{\\max}^2$，内侧再同样一份：", "$\\rho v_{\\max}^2 = 1.2 \\times 6400 = \\qty{7.7}{kPa}$，中心处比环境压强低。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:euler-bernoulli:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\rho g \\times 150 = \\qty{14.7}{bar}$ 高于大气压；$\\tfrac12\\rho gH_d^2", "\\times \\qty{1}{m} = \\qty{1.1e8}{N}$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\rho gH = \\qty{19.6}{bar}$ 表压，\\qty{20.6}{bar} 绝对压强。", ""]}